    `Peter`
    `Gyon`
    `Andrew of the Chancery`
    `Gyon de Cygony`
    `Geoffrey de Martyn`
    `a brother of Geoffrey de Martyn`
    `Philip Mark`
    `a brother of Philip Mark`
    `Geoffrey, nephew of Philip Mark`
    `another of the whole brood of the same`
    `someone not named in the chapter`

